				DATAFORM 「%K33_MOAN()%... %SPLIT_G("You know full well that my:Don't you know that my")% %FSYN("ass")%는 이것에 너무 %SPLIT_G("sensitive:weak")%해...!%UNICODE(0x2764)%」
